    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Experience the Thrill of MMORPG Raiding, All by Yourself</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the stress of finding party members or waiting for your guild. In Chaos Bringer, you alone hold the power to conquer epic raid bosses through your own strategic brilliance. Command your party of 8 heroes and claim victory on your terms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Are the Commander, a Genius of the Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause time at any moment to predict the enemy's next move. Issue the perfect sequence of commands to your heroes and watch your flawless plan unfold. Your foresight turns the tide of battle, combining skills on the Timeline system to create devastatingly powerful combos like a symphony of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/144b8250b0dc4bc381a75d6392eb7f57.poster.avif?t=1751652312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/144b8250b0dc4bc381a75d6392eb7f57.webm?t=1751652312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/144b8250b0dc4bc381a75d6392eb7f57.mp4?t=1751652312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Breathtaking Battle of Wits Against Giant Raid Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the core of MMORPG fun, now designed for a solo player. Face mighty bosses with diverse, multi-phase patterns that will test your tactical mind. Monitor Threat and DPS in real-time to perfectly control the flow of combat, pushing your damage to the limit while keeping your tank alive. Every second is a thrilling choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/f1f52364b92b61207e953637a80cfac1.poster.avif?t=1751652312\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/f1f52364b92b61207e953637a80cfac1.webm?t=1751652312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/f1f52364b92b61207e953637a80cfac1.mp4?t=1751652312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Moment of Progression is Pure Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the boring grind behind. Every part of Chaos Bringer is an interconnected gear in a grand machine, constantly giving you new goals and new ways to have fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/427616262ac0b071f7543ff5c4798f38.poster.avif?t=1751652312\" width=716 height=402 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/427616262ac0b071f7543ff5c4798f38.webm?t=1751652312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3119830/extras/427616262ac0b071f7543ff5c4798f38.mp4?t=1751652312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Explore:</strong> Dive into ever-changing, roguelike dungeons. Experience fast-paced, strategic combat where every run is a new and exciting challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Immerse:</strong> Your journey follows a rich, compelling storyline. You're not just leveling up; you're the protagonist shaping the fate of this world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Create:</strong> Use materials from your adventures to craft custom gear that completes your unique strategies. Build a tank focused on Evasion instead of standard defense and outsmart the raid with your own creative builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4. Conquer:</strong> It's time to prove your growth. The greatest honors and Epic gear can only be earned in raids. Defeat colossal bosses with your unique builds and masterful command to become a legend.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add to Your Wishlist and Prepare for Your Legendary Raid!</strong></p>",
